   155	def load_approved_digests(path=None):
   156	    """Read the committed exp_07 pins; return a frozen view and the file's identity.
   157	
   158	    ``evaluator`` pins tools.exp07_eval's closure and ``writer`` tools.exp04_eval_launch's;
   159	    ``training_launcher`` is the list of admissible training-launcher closures and
   160	    ``training`` the single closure all three arms must share.  The committed all-null
   161	    template loads -- the schema is reviewable before anything is approved -- but every
   162	    producer refuses those nulls in production; only --exploratory lists them as
   163	    deviations.  Pins are all-null or all-filled: a half-filled file is refused.
